ion":"Leaders of six major auto trade groups joined to sign a letter to the president.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/18/xi-visit-automakers-urge-trump-to-bar-chinese-automakers-in-us.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-18T17:11:39Z"},{"title":"Disney names CTO for the first time as media giant expands tech push","description":"Disney has hired a chief technology officer, a newly minted role for the company, as it looks to further its embrace of tech under CEO Josh D'Amaro.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/18/disney-cto-tech.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-18T16:14:26Z"},{"title":"Wendy's franchisee files for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection as burger chain struggles","description":"One of Wendy's biggest U.S. franchisees, Meritage Hospitality Group, filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/18/wendys-franchisee-files-for-chapter-11-bankruptcy-protection.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-18T16:13:00Z"},{"title":"Nike parts ways with Kylian Mbappé; soccer superstar signs with On","description":"Mbappe had been signed with Nike for roughly two decades, and his agreement with On is the first it has made with a soccer player.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/18/kylian-mbappe-signs-with-on-after-nike-parts-ways.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-18T19:30:55Z"},{"title":"Bank of America expects third-quarter investment banking fees to fall more than 10%; shares slide","description":"The muted outlook could be an early signal that Wall Street's AI boom might have hit turbulence.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/14/bank-of-america-bac-q3-investment-banking-fees.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-14T20:34:23Z"},{"title":"GM plans U.S. battery development as Trump's DOT attacks Ford for China ties","description":"Most battery cells currently rely on raw materials from China. GM is seeking to establish domestic supply chains both for EVs and energy storage.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/12/gm-us-battery-development-ford-china-ties.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-14T01:05:56Z"},{"title":"Potential AI slowdown is not 'end of the world' for data center real estate, says Digital Realty CEO","description":"Digital Realty and Equinix saw their stocks slump after warnings over AI advancements.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/15/data-center-reit-ceo-ai-slowdown.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-15T12:28:15Z"},{"title":"OpenAI targets work of Wall Street junior bankers with new ChatGPT for Financial Services","description":"OpenAI launched ChatGPT for Financial Services, targeting research, modeling and pitchbook tasks traditionally handled by junior bankers.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/10/openai-chatgpt-for-financial-services-targets-work-of-junior-bankers.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-11T16:06:31Z"},{"title":"J.B. Hunt stock plunges 13% after company warns third-quarter earnings will fall","description":"Shares of J.B. Hunt plunged 13% after the company warned of an earnings drop between 5% and 10%.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/16/jb-hunt-stock-jbht-earnings.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-16T20:00:36Z"},{"title":"Boeing CEO: 737 Max production taking 'a little bit longer' to stabilize than expected","description":"Boeing CEO Kelly Ortberg said wing production at its Renton, Washington, factory is a hold up.","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/16/boeing-ceo-737-max-production.html","source":"CNBC","publishedAt":"2026-09-16T19:36:24Z"}]}